     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I actually ended up reading this article and it indeed helped me. <div>I solved it by storing the session vars in a reactiveValues list, it&#39;s exactly what I needed and in fact I think it&#39;s almost the exact equivalent of the session vars (coding wise).</div><div>Thanks!</div></div>"
